So if there was a drug that reduced alkaline phosphatase levels, would that be a good thing to take

00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:47,920
if my alkaline phosphatase levels are going up? No, that wouldn't be good. I don't that's

00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:52,720
what you're asking, but no, that would not be a good thing to take because we don't want to artificially

