lower marker level that's telling us something. It's trying to tell us something. We don't want to put a

00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:05,760
piece of tape over its mouth, but it's trying to tell us something. So how would you go through

00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:13,520
a process of differential diagnosis with somebody who has metastasis to bone and is unfed metazole

00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:20,320
and they have elevated alkaline phosphatase? Well a couple things. If my alkaline phosphatase is elevated

00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:28,000
is my calcium also elevated, is my calcium moving in a direction of going up over time

00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:36,000
along with my alkaline phosphatase? If the answer to that is yes, then it's more likely due to the

00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:43,120
metastasis of bone because remember alkaline phosphatase will be elevated due to irritation in the

00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:48,160
liver. That couldn't be from a drug, right? From fed metazole, one drug could be from chemo

00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:54,320
therapy too, could be from other drugs, could be from Tylenol. So you could get an elevated alkaline

00:01:54,400 --> 00:02:03,200
phosphatase with that. Many times with a drug, you'll also get an elevated AST and ALT, sometimes not,

00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:10,000
but that would be another clue. But when you have metastasis to bone with bony destruction,

00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:15,360
alkaline phosphatase is in bone two. So it will spill alkaline phosphatase. You'll get an elevated

00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:22,320
alkaline phosphatase with bony destruction. But with bony destruction that elevated alkaline phosphatase

00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:28,640
will more commonly be associated also with elevated calcium because you're going to get spillage

00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:35,840
of calcium from the bone into the blood. So you're going to have with the differential diagnosis is

00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:43,840
if I have elevated alkaline phosphatase and elevated calcium, it's more likely, nothing's going

00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:50,320
to be perfect, but it's more likely due to bony destruction. If I have elevated alkaline phosphatase

00:02:50,320 --> 00:02:57,360
and speared calcium, I mean my calcium is actually going down, but I also have elevated AST and

