could be for Mendezol. So that's partly how you would look at it, but you'd also look at

00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:19,680
subjective things. Do I have more bone pain? Okay, that could be a sign that the elevated alkaline

00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:26,480
phosphatase is coming from my bone. So there's other things that you look at too, but that's the key

